              "text": "die Rettung — \"the rescue\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Die Rettung kam in letzter Minute. The rescue came at the last minute."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Rettungen. In Austria, die Rettung is also the ambulance service."
            }
          ]
        },
